"children":["Attack an Object"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_an_Object","referenceId":"reference:caaf24587149e3b5"},")).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If the Bronzium Cast Armor is disabled or destroyed, it no longer provides any bonuses to the wearer. A suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," pushed down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," imposes its condition penalties to the wearer's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," only.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
